    "sections": {
        "description": "The Organic Online Shop Theme is designed with a clean layout and structured sections suitable for displaying natural, eco-focused, and product-based content. It includes responsive design support, customizable homepage sections, banner areas, product display layouts, and typography controls for flexible styling. The theme supports image galleries, featured collections, blog sections, and navigation menus for organized browsing across devices. It is compatible with common page builder plugins and includes basic customization options through the customizer panel. The layout structure is optimized for readability and balanced spacing, helping maintain a consistent visual presentation. Additional features include social media integration, footer widget areas, call-to-action sections, and WooCommerce compatibility for product management and online transactions. The theme also supports SEO-friendly coding practices, fast-loading layouts, and cross-browser compatibility to ensure stable performance across modern web browsers and screen sizes."
    },
